    "attribution": "00144p:《好想做，唔想做》I Do and I Don’t\n \nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any reused or repurposed content must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n \nAttribution Text \n\n\n\"I Do and I Don't\" (Cantonese), translated by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2020) from Do and Don't (English), written by Radha HS, illustrated by Ruchi Shah, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2010) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in\n \n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
    "timing": "untimed",
