    "attribution": "00101p:《Rani 返學喇！》A School for Everyone\n \nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any reused or repurposed content must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n \nAttribution Text \n\n\n“A School For Everyone” (Cantonese), translated by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2020), based on original story Rani's First Day at School (English), written by Cheryl Rao, illustrated by Mayur Mistry, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2015) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in\n\n\n \n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
    "timing": "untimed",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "at": 0,
        "label": "2a",
        "text": "今日我第一日返學。媽媽拖住我隻手，同我一齊行。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 6,
        "label": "2b",
        "text": "我大個女喇！行啦！行啦！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 9,
        "label": "3a",
        "text": "呢度係學校。有好多小朋友啊！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 13,
        "label": "3b",
        "text": "有人搭巴士，有人坐車，有人踩單車",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 17,
        "label": "3c",
        "text": "有人行路返學，同我一樣。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 20,
        "label": "4a",
        "text": "我哋到門口。媽媽企喺門口，我自己行入去。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 26,
        "label": "4b",
        "text": "呢度好多人。我唔識佢哋。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 29,
        "label": "5a",
        "text": "一步。兩步。我行下停下。好驚啊！媽媽呢？",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 34,
        "label": "5b",
        "text": "我跑返去媽媽度。我要媽媽，我唔 想返學！",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 39,
        "label": "6a",
        "text": "大家都入晒去喇！老師行出嚟。",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 43,
        "label": "6b",
        "text": "老師話：「Rani 早晨，你啲朋友等緊你啊！」",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 49,
        "label": "6c",
        "text": "媽媽話：「媽媽喺度等你放學」",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      },
      {
        "at": 53,
        "label": "7",
        "text": "「拜拜媽咪，我返學喇！」",
        "jyutping": "",
        "terms": []
      }
    ]
