    "attribution": "00065:《我想揸巴士返學！》I Wanna Drive a Bus to School!\n \nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any reused or repurposed content must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n \nAttribution Text \n\n\n“I Wanna Drive a Bus to School!” (Cantonese), written by Connie, illustrated by CHOICEZ, published by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2021) under a CC BY 4.0 license on hambaanglaang.hk\n \n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
    "timing": "untimed",
